msgctxt "136"
msgid "What the hell...?"
msgstr "[Ma che diavolo...]"

msgctxt "148"
msgid "I'm not wasting any more time on you. Step aside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Is a guy named Zen here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Huh? What do you want?"
msgstr "Hm? Che vuoi?"

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I'm with the Honest Living Association. Now, release those\r\n"
"hostages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "No way! What is the HLA doing here!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"If you thought taking hostages would stop us from coming\r\n"
"after you, then you're dumber than I thought."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"We're freeing those hostages, even if it means beating some sense into you "
"first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Hey! Go report this to Zen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr "Capito!"

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"Who do you think you are, some kind of superhero or\r\n"
"something? You must be gettin' senile in your old age!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"After a good ass-kicking, you can join your friends...\r\n"
"as another hostage!"
msgstr ""

